 Initialise connected;tabs;i;name;folder;app;tb;sf
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected

 'F1'eWC'Form' 'EWC Plugin Gallery'(30 30)(1090 1010)('Coord' 'Pixel')
 'F1.TC'eWC'TabControl'('Posn'(0 0))('Size'(1090 1010))

 tabs←,⊂('Fireworks' 'fireworks' #.FireworksApp)
 tabs,←⊂('Globe' 'globe' #.GlobeApp)
 tabs,←⊂('ApexCharts' 'apexcharts' #.ApexApp)
 tabs,←⊂('Kendo' 'kendo' #.KendoApp)

 :For i :In ⍳≢tabs
     (name folder app)←i⊃tabs
     (tb←'F1.TC.T',⍕i)eWC'TabButton'('Caption'name)
⍝ The client forces a TabObj SubForm to Posn 0 0 over the whole TabControl,
⍝ tab strip included; the translate pushes the page below the strip
     (sf←'F1.TC.SF',⍕i)eWC'SubForm'('TabObj'tb)('CSS' 'transform: translateY(30px)')
     (sf,'.LINK')eWC'Link'('https://github.com/dyalog-labs/ewc-plugins/tree/main/',folder)('ewc-plugins/',folder)('Posn' 10 720)
     (('T',(⍕i),'_')sf)Reroot app
     ⍎'T',(⍕i),'_Initialise 1'
 :EndFor

 {}eDQ'F1'
